---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Client guide | Avexel" description="What to prepare for an Avexel website project, how development works, and what to expect for pricing, ownership, and support.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-intro">
      <a class="back-link" href="/">← Home</a>
      <h1>Client guide</h1>
      <p>What to prepare, how we work, and what happens after launch.</p>
    </header>
    <article class="guide">
      <h2>What to send us</h2>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:contact@avexel.co">contact@avexel.co</a> or use the <a href="/#contact">contact form</a>. Include whatever you know about:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your organization, audience, and what visitors should be able to do on the website.</li>
        <li>An existing website, if you have one, and what needs to change.</li>
        <li>Required features, budget, and any deadlines.</li>
        <li>Available logos, photos, and written content.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Design and development</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Scope:</strong> We agree on pages, features, timeline, and price before development begins.</li>
        <li><strong>Design:</strong> You review the layouts and visual direction and provide feedback.</li>
        <li><strong>Development:</strong> We build the site and share a working preview for testing.</li>
        <li><strong>Launch:</strong> We help configure hosting and your domain, publish the site, and explain how to manage it.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Pricing</h2>
      <p>We quote each project based on its pages, features, and integrations. The website build is a one-time project cost. Domain registration, hosting, and third-party services are separate costs that we’ll discuss before work begins.</p>

      <h2>Ownership</h2>
      <p>You own the website’s code and content. You can choose where to host it and who maintains it. We can help with the technical setup and handoff.</p>

      <h2>Updates and support</h2>
      <p>We can handle content changes, maintenance, and additional features after launch. We agree on support arrangements and any ongoing costs as part of your project.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:contact@avexel.co">contact@avexel.co</a><br /><a href="tel:+12313738360">(231) 373-8360</a></p>
    </article>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
